      "writtenOn": "2024-07-23T12:39:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think no because the clients would naturally sync all properties when a new device is found?\n\nBut this reminds me that we probably want to fire a OnDeviceFound in `BleDiscoveryScannerResult` if the device doesn\u0027t exist. WDYT?",
