      "writtenOn": "2024-07-23T12:51:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e the clients would naturally sync all properties when a new device is found\n\nProbably either that doesn\u0027t happen or it does that wrong then. I saw some properties there that isn\u0027t propagated to the UI as well (notably the UUIDs).\n\n\u003e we probably want to fire a OnDeviceFound in BleDiscoveryScannerResult if the device doesn\u0027t exist\n\nAgree, but then we might also be better checking that we don\u0027t re-report the device in the `device_found` callback, because these callbacks seems possible to be called in any order.\nAnd also sometimes it\u0027s called only in either one of them... I don\u0027t really get what\u0027s going on.",
      "parentUuid": "a7276df2_f2f4dc0e",
      "revId": "3aea49e5cb9be272a17bfd501270c150864b0998",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
